cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SACRA — Agro-climate risk assessment and index insurance pricing for Surkhandarya wheat"
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alisher
    family-names: Abdullayev
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-9607-680X"
    affiliation: "Termez State University of Engineering and Agrotechnologies"
    email: alisher_abdullayev@tersu.uz
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline for assessing extreme climate risk in irrigated
  wheat production and designing an area-yield index insurance product for
  Surkhandarya region, Uzbekistan. Covers detrending, climate–yield association
  testing, robustness diagnostics (jackknife, permutation, partial correlation),
  extreme value modelling (Gumbel with bootstrap confidence intervals and an
  explicit GEV identifiability check), VaR/CVaR risk measures, actuarial pricing,
  and quantitative basis-risk measurement at district level.
keywords:
  - index insurance
  - area-yield insurance
  - extreme value theory
  - basis risk
  - wheat
  - Uzbekistan
  - Central Asia
repository-code: "https://github.com/alishersadullayevich97-create/sacra-index-insurance"
license: MIT
